WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:37.210
LEINA'S BLOOD

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:37.210
(Part 1)

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:11.760
Lady Leina?

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.000
I'm sorry.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.340
Please, I can do things like that.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:19.630
Oh no, Lord Glemy will
scold me for that.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.760
Please, do not move your finger.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.630
What the...

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.080
So this is what's going on here.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.980
This is why they all came
down to Dakar, right?

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.050
Let's go!

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:17.230
Looks like it will be
impossible during the day.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.600
I told you, the real
fight's gonna be at night.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:23.900
I heard there'll be a big party at the state
guest house, so that's where we'll strike.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:27.990
We'll be eating Leina's
cooking again soon, huh?

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:29.660
- Hey, Elle...
- Huh?

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:33.260
Would you consider quitting the
Gundam Team after we save Leina?

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.080
Why?

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:39.670
I want you to take Leina to some colony
somewhere, where you can live peacefully.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:41.920
I'll send enough money
for you two to live on.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.550
What about you, Judau?

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.060
I'll keep fighting
until this war is over.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:50.150
I'm gonna scare the crap
outta these selfish adults.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.010
I see where you're coming from, but...

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:55.680
If I'm gonna do that, I
don't want Leina by my side.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.020
But Judau, I want--

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.270
Hey!

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:02.080
Roux's group is back!
And dinner's ready!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:04.120
All right!

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:08.320
Right! I'll do my best, too!

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.800
Just relax, Leina.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:29.170
Tonight, as part of the evening's festivities,
you'll debut as part of Neo-Zeon's high society.

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:31.800
I pray that this will be
a wonderful memory for you.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:32.840
Yes.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:35.770
Then let's head out.
It's almost time.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:50.280
Leina, tonight's the night.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.200
I swear I'll rescue you!

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:54.500
Judau Ashta, launching!

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:58.830
- Judau!
- You can't!

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:01.540
No! I want to be with Judau!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.210
Ple! Don't be so selfish!

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:07.340
Judau has to have me with him!

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.510
No way!

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:21.640
So that's Lady Mineva Zabi.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.850
I assumed she was merely a body double.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.490
There can be no doubt! It
is the girl from the videos.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:32.280
This is Her Majesty, Mineva
Zabi, great leader of the Neo-Zeon.

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:36.700
Her Majesty, in Axis, far
from the Earth Sphere,

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:42.910
has prayed night and day for harmony and
prosperity among Earthnoids and Spacenoids.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:45.670
Today, on this great occasion, Her
Majesty is delighted...

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:51.130
to see the footprints of Neo-Zeon
upon this city called Dakar.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.440
Before you all, who gathered
here so graciously tonight,

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:56.340
I, Haman, Her Majesty's
guardian, speak on her behalf...

00:05:56.340 --> 00:06:02.690
and give heartfelt thanks all those involved
with the Earth Federation's government.

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:18.700
You'll get used to it soon.
Just don't forget to smile.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.130
Yes.

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:42.340
I am honored I was given the privilege
to be invited to such a grand occasion.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:44.850
Leina, watch closely.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:47.640
The guests you see here are
officials of the Earth Federation.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:53.490
They are people that survive by
currying favor from the strong, as you see here.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:55.490
The Earth Federation...

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:59.120
Didn't they want the Zabi family
eradicated in the first place?

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:12.800
What is this? Everyone here is lying.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:16.480
Not one person here is laughing
from the bottom of their heart!

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:19.840
What's the point of all this brown-nosing?
Is this what it means to be an adult?

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:21.940
What in the world are these people?!

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.400
Leina?

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.770
Don't fool around with
them. They aren't toys!

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:34.190
- I'm going to shoot!
- Not yet!

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:35.440
I'm shooting now!

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:39.740
It's still too early! What's with you?
So what if Judau left you behind?

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:41.580
I can tell it's time!

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.300
This isn't right!

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:51.680
I'd rather die than grow
up to be someone like this!

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:54.500
What?!

00:07:56.860 --> 00:08:00.770
Mondo! What are you doing?!
That was way too early!

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.800
Ple did it all by herself!

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.640
I'm gonna shoot again!

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.520
At least aim better this time!

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:09.790
If you hit the state guest
house, Judau's gonna slap you!

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.160
Yeah! I don't want to be slapped!

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:17.990
Suppress them, quickly.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:19.530
Yes, my lady.

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:23.040
Stay here. There's
nothing to worry about.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.170
Big Brother...

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:53.480
Everyone! Please, calm down!

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:55.120
This is all part of the ceremony!

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:59.130
It is my understanding that some of you
are not yet convinced of Neo-Zeon's power.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:04.070
So we have lured over one
of Karaba's squads.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:08.640
We would like you to have an up-close
look at our military skill.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.710
Remember, this is merely
part of the ceremony.

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:20.430
Lady Haman, take Lady Mineva.

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.270
I can leave the rest of
this to you?

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:24.640
Yes.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:28.310
Let us go, Lady Mineva.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:32.440
Big Brother...

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.700
Wait for me, Leina!

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:52.170
Thank you, Roux!

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.660
What are you doing there?

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:14.110
- You look really suspicious!
- D-Don't shoot!

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:18.160
A mobile suit came crashing down!
So I came to tell you guys about it!

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.230
What?! Which way?!

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:22.280
That way! Over there!

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:23.740
Let's go!

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.030
What should I do...?

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:31.880
I guess I have to climb up.

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:35.670
Roux!

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:40.680
Judau?!

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:43.720
All right!

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.100
Good going, Roux!

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.330
Leina...

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:13.870
- Big Brother!
- If we can maintain a relationship of cooperation,

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:17.460
I am sure that it will be highly
profitable to your side.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.380
If we use our combined forces,

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:24.460
we could easily capture all of
Jupiter's helium-farming ships.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:29.340
How scary. Still young, and
so full of energy.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:31.010
He seems very dependable.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:33.160
This is probably a sign
of the times as well.

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:36.100
Glemy, I'm not feeling well.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.790
Hmm? Then, you should
rest in your quarters.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:39.820
Hey!

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:44.450
It's all right. I can go back by myself.

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:48.570
Yes, there's something different
about Neo-Zeon's people.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:50.870
She is so young, but already
such a magnificent lady.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:55.000
Thank you. I will take that
as a sincere compliment.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:00.910
He's here... He's definitely nearby!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.090
Big Brother!

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.450
This sensation...

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:28.400
Lady Haman?

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.700
See to Lady Mineva!

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:30.790
Yes, my lady.

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:40.920
I have lost my faith
in you, Judau Ashta.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.700
I didn't think you
would be this childish.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:47.660
Sorry about ruining your party.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.050
Freeze!

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:51.220
Do you not realize it?!

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:55.890
The men and women who came to this party and
wagged their tails at Neo-Zeon...

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:58.620
They are the very root of the evil
that defiles the Earth!

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:01.740
Maybe, but that doesn't mean
anything you're doing is right.

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:05.770
Back in the asteroid belt, I stared
into the freezing depths of space...

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:09.490
I lived that way for many years.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:14.380
During those years, what did
the foolish people of Earth do?

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:19.200
They rebuilt quickly, caring nothing
for the polluted state of this planet.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.930
In the end, they made the
pollution even worse!

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:24.680
I cannot forgive that!

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:33.800
You know, when I'm with you, I feel
able to speak my mind without hesitation.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.180
What a strange feeling.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:39.060
Talk all you want, but I'm
not gonna be your man.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.200
I know that.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:44.600
There is the feeling of
a Newtype about you,

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.750
but you don't understand how
to accept your lot in life.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:51.500
If you keep relying on your instincts,
you'll come to ruin someday.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:55.650
I don't care about Newtypes! All
I want to do is to save Leina!

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:59.860
Even in a situation like this,
you act only upon your emotions.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.460
When we first met, you
showed such promise...

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.960
But in the bitter end,
you betray me, too.

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:07.470
Judau Ashta, you're
just like the others!

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.880
Big Brother!

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:14.800
Leina!

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.560
Big Brother!

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:20.560
I see... She's your weakness.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:27.060
Glemy Toto held your trump card all this time,
Judau Ashta, and yet could make no use of it.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:29.560
But that trump card is no longer--

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:31.820
- You can't!
- Get away, Leina!

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:35.400
No! This time, I'm going
to save you, Big Brother!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.580
Leina, this fight isn't--

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:42.360
I can't stand such clingy behavior.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:45.260
Finish your touching reunion
in the heavens beyond!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.550
Big Brother!

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:08.730
Leina!

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:10.360
Get a grip!

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.530
Leina!

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:15.240
Big Brother...

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:31.180
What?

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:33.640
This feeling...

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:39.180
What is it?!

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:43.810
What is it?!

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:45.650
Big brother Judau?!

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:51.020
Haman...!

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:52.700
S-Stay away!

00:15:56.710 --> 00:16:01.670
Ugh... what is this foul sensation,
clinging to my skin...?

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.290
Excuse me for a moment.

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:07.080
What is the meaning of this?

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:10.260
Haman and Mineva have
already taken their leave!

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:15.910
It's no good! Make a run for
it! It's dangerous here!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.850
Don't come near me! Stay away!

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:26.400
S-Stop it!

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.370
What is that?!

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:47.290
- Lady Haman?!
- Out of my way!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:50.500
Lady Haman?! What is the matter?!

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.720
Lady Haman!

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:02.840
To think he could exert
such pressure against me!

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:06.020
Judau Ashta... he is
unimaginably dangerous!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.020
Big Brother...

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:11.100
I can stand...

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:12.810
You shouldn't! Don't move.

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:17.020
This time, I'll be the one to
save you, Big Brother. So...

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:18.480
Why can't we get out?

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.800
Is Neo-Zeon trying to kill us?!

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:22.700
Please go back inside!

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.240
It's very dangerous outside!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.620
These are Lady Haman's orders!

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:29.450
So you want us to wait inside
for the bombs to fall?

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:33.460
Karaba will not attack as long as Earth
Federation personnel are present!

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.160
My name is Leina!

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:39.690
I am returning to the Sadalahn with this
young man upon Lord Glemy Toto's orders!

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:40.980
Let me through!

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:43.130
Why can she pass, but not us?

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:44.760
Just because you're Neo-Zeon...!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:46.100
We are--

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:47.850
Hush, all of you!

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:52.110
Why did you all attend this party?!

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:56.400
You were all prepared to face the
consequences of leaving the Earth in Neo-Zeon's hands.

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:59.120
So you should be prepared to follow
our orders to the very end.

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:03.840
Unless you wish to be held on charges of
treason, return immediately to your party.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:07.540
I command you on behalf
of Lady Mineva Zabi!

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:10.680
Leina...

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:13.460
Thank you so much, Lady Leina!

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:15.170
That was so moving!

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:19.760
To see someone so young
standing so proudly...

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:23.420
It makes me truly glad that
I am on Neo-Zeon's side!

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:25.130
Thank you for your hard work.

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:26.190
Ma'am!

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:31.220
If you would like, I can
escort you back to the Sadalahn.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:34.230
Your job is to guard
this entrance, is it not?

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:36.480
Ma'am! Forgive my error.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.320
Dammit, Leina... where did you go?

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:44.820
Leina, that was amazing...
I underestimated you.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:47.720
Glemy taught me well.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.240
Does it hurt?

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:50.580
I'm all right.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:54.030
I'm such a bad girl,
telling all those lies.

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:57.720
At this rate, heaven won't want me.

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:01.420
Don't say things like that! We'll
be back with Elle and the guys soon!

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:02.880
Just do your best to hang on!

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.110
Okay....

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:07.340
You let Leina leave with some boy?!

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:11.240
Y-Yes. She said it was
your orders, Lord Glemy.

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:13.820
Why would I give such an order?!

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:18.110
This is...?

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.270
Who goes there?!

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:24.150
What are you doing there!?

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:26.540
She's wounded, so let me through!

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:29.370
Let me through, please!

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:33.170
If I just stand here, my little
sister is going to die!

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:36.000
What?!

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:47.930
Enemy reinforcements!

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:55.440
Is that it?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.270
Damn you, Judau!

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:06.240
I'm not going to let you take Leina
back, after all I've invested in her!

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:14.580
Just hang in there, Leina. I'll find
someone to take care of you soon!

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:23.590
No good! I have to transform
into the Double Zeta!

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:25.600
Iino, get over here!

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:33.150
It's the signal from Judau!

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:35.640
Iino, go in! I'll cover you!

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:36.980
Okay!

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.570
Roux! To your front!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:43.410
I won't let you do as you please!

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.040
Iino!

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:57.080
Glemy!

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.120
What? Is that Roux Louka?!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.220
Learn when to quit!

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:07.680
Leina, hang on!

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:11.480
What the hell is Iino doing?!

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:14.470
There! Open fire!

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:17.180
Eh? But you can't see anything!

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:18.940
Judau is in trouble!

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:24.200
What?!

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:25.990
Leina?!

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:28.690
Hang in there!

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:31.320
This isn't good... I have to
get her to a doctor soon!

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:33.410
This is no time to be fighting!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:41.670
The signal flare!
I need to get over there!

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:48.010
They just keep coming!
We gotta be careful with this!

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:54.980
Are those reinforcements?!

00:21:57.820 --> 00:22:00.350
Hang in there, Leina!

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:03.280
What?!

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:09.200
Stop it! We can't fight now!

00:22:17.590 --> 00:22:20.040
No good! I've lost control!

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:27.340
Hold together!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:52.150
Leina was wounded, so I had
to leave her with Ple.

00:23:52.150 --> 00:23:55.490
I didn't realize that they were
both feeling pretty overwhelmed.

00:23:55.490 --> 00:23:57.500
I guess I got carried away.

00:23:57.920 --> 00:24:01.080
And then one of
Glemy's troops crashes a mobile suit...

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:04.460
right on top of the building
that the girls are inside!

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.880
Next time on Gundam ZZ: "Leina's Blood."

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:09.000
Next Time

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:09.000
LEINA'S BLOOD

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:09.000
(Part 2)

00:24:08.630 --> 00:24:10.190
What a pathetic Newtype!
